       >>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. AST.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 A-I PIC 9(4).
LINKAGE SECTION.
    COPY "compiler-state.cpy".
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING COMPILER-STATE.
MAIN-AST.
    DISPLAY "----- ABSTRACT SYNTAX TREE -----"
    DISPLAY "Nodes: " CS-AST-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING A-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL A-I > CS-AST-COUNT
        DISPLAY A-I " " FUNCTION TRIM(CS-AST-TYPE(A-I))
          " value=[" FUNCTION TRIM(CS-AST-VALUE(A-I))
          "] left=" CS-AST-LEFT(A-I)
          " right=" CS-AST-RIGHT(A-I)
          " third=" CS-AST-THIRD(A-I)
          " next=" CS-AST-NEXT(A-I)
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY "----- END AST -----"
    GOBACK.
